:'''Seele:''' Hey, you! Are you in charge around here?
:'''Team Leader:''' A local? The IPC is currently conducting asset evaluation work here. Local residents are advised to follow those responsible for evacuation to the&mdash;
:'''Seele:''' Don't lie to us! You seized the mine by force for yourself &mdash; you drove the locals out of their homes!
:'''Seele:''' I'm warning you &mdash; get lost or suffer the consequences! Don't you dare show your face around here again!
:'''Team Leader:''' And who might you be? You have quite the attitude... This is our jurisdiction now &mdash; we are all-powerful here.
